{"id":"0455ac768bd466bb","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-local-modal-deduction.md","title":"Local Modal Deduction and Consistency","display":"lem-local-modal-deduction — Local Modal Deduction and Consistency","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-local-modal-deduction","aliases":["89-lem-local-modal-deduction"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-local-modal-deduction — Local Modal Deduction and Consistency","depends_on":["[[89-df-local-modal-consequence]]","[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-local-modal-deduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-local-modal-deduction</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-local-modal-deduction — Local Modal Deduction and Consistency"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"413ee4c6aedeb326\" href=\"?note=413ee4c6aedeb326\" title=\"89-df-local-modal-consequence\">89-df-local-modal-consequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"38f802289559e5da\" href=\"?note=38f802289559e5da\" title=\"89-df-modal-consistent-set\">89-df-modal-consistent-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_L\\)</span> 为局部一致性，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}\">\\(\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}\\)</span> 为有限局部后果。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}local\\text{-}modal\\text{-}deduction}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma\\cup\\{B\\}\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}A\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}(B\\to A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}_L(\\Gamma)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(\\Gamma\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}\\bot).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}local\\text{-}modal\\text{-}deduction}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma\\cup\\{B\\}\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}A\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}(B\\to A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}_L(\\Gamma)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(\\Gamma\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}\\bot).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 85–87；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>前式正向：从有限见证中移去 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的各次出现，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\bigwedge\\Delta\\land B\\to A)\\in L\">\\((\\bigwedge\\Delta\\land B\\to A)\\in L\\)</span>，再用重言式换成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge\\Delta\\to(B\\to A)\">\\(\\bigwedge\\Delta\\to(B\\to A)\\)</span>。逆向把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 接到见证序列末尾。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg C\">\\(\\neg C\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\to\\bot\">\\(C\\to\\bot\\)</span> 的命题等价得到。两处都只使用重言式和 MP，不必然化局部假设。这是原书有限一致性论证的直接展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-local-modal-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"413ee4c6aedeb326","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-local-modal-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-consistent-set","status":"resolved","id":"38f802289559e5da","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}local\\text{-}modal\\text{-}deduction}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma\\cup\\{B\\}\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}A\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}(B\\to A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}_L(\\Gamma)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(\\Gamma\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}\\bot).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"(\\bigwedge\\Delta\\land B\\to A)\\in L","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge\\Delta\\to(B\\to A)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg C","display":false},{"tex":"C\\to\\bot","display":false}],"bytes":1420,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-77","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]] → [[89-df-local-modal-consequence]] → [[89-lem-local-modal-deduction]] → [[89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties]] → [[89-lem-lindenbaum-modal]] → [[89-df-canonical-model]] → [[89-lem-canonical-successor]] → [[89-lem-canonical-truth]] → [[89-thm-canonical-model]]"}],"outgoing":["413ee4c6aedeb326","38f802289559e5da"]}